{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "a_room_001",
      "text": "Dusty books line a shelf to your left. A doorway leads south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_002",
      "text": "Your room is plain, as befits a sixteenth-century gentleman of La Mancha. Stairs lead down. You can also go north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_003",
      "text": "In the dim light from the door you see a chest. Dust conceals memories of your ancestors. You can go south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_004",
      "text": "Only a forlorn cupboard remains in this old, cosy kitchen. Doors lead south and north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_005",
      "text": "You are in the entrance hall. A wide staircase leads upstairs. You can go up, north, south or east."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_006",
      "text": "A candle lights your gateway to a new life. The gate is east; another door lies west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_007",
      "text": "You are in your simple dining room. A wooden table stands here. Something hangs on the wall. A door leads north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_032",
      "text": "Argamansilla del Alba, your village. Its empty streets lie silent. What does the notice on the wall say? Streets lead east and south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_034",
      "text": "The plains of La Mancha lie far to the south. Is this the last street in the village?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_031",
      "text": "You reach the arch. The forest awaits to the east, cool and mysterious. You can go west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_044",
      "text": "Forest or jungle? These woods may hold great surprises. Paths lead north and west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_043",
      "text": "An apple tree! What a strange forest, offering such delicious fruit. The path runs north to south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_042",
      "text": "You walk through a pine wood. Tiny flowers cover the ground. You can go north, south or west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_041",
      "text": "You are in a leafy wood. A door lies east. The forest continues south. You can also go west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_022",
      "text": "A huge stone wall blocks the path. You can go east or south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_021",
      "text": "You are beyond the wall. The path ends to the south. Go east to return."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_025",
      "text": "You enter the barren plains of La Mancha. The village is north; another path leads west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_026",
      "text": "You are still in La Mancha. An inn stands west. The path runs east to south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_027",
      "text": "You are in La Mancha. Sheep stand to the east. Go north to return."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_045",
      "text": "A small ravine lies before you, to the west. East looks safer."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_046",
      "text": "You have crossed the ravine! This place looks unpleasant. East seems best."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_014",
      "text": "A fine bedroom, dominated by a bed. You can return east."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_015",
      "text": "You are on the first landing. Torchlight reveals doors to the east and west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_016",
      "text": "You are in the inn's cellar. Huge wineskins stand in a corner. The exit is west."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_017",
      "text": "Stairs fill the room. A wall candle lights it. You can go south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_018",
      "text": "You are in the inn's hall. How many guests have slept here? The main door is west; another exit lies north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_012",
      "text": "A candle lights this cosy hall. Doors to the east, west and south lead through the inn."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_013",
      "text": "A lonely dining room lies before you. The table is bare. You can go north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_009",
      "text": "Torchlight reveals two doors, north and south."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_008",
      "text": "An inn bedroom, complete with the customary bed. Go south to return."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_010",
      "text": "You are in the yard. Apart from the moon, little is visible. A door leads north."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_080",
      "text": "You fall into Lake Ruidera. Unable to swim, you drown."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_room_033",
      "text": "Another street! Will you go north or south?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_239",
      "text": "You carry"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_240",
      "text": ">"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_241",
      "text": "You cannot."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_242",
      "text": "Pardon?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_243",
      "text": "Press a key..."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_244",
      "text": "Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_245",
      "text": "You already have it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_246",
      "text": "You do not have it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_247",
      "text": "I cannot see it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_248",
      "text": "You carry too much to take that."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_251",
      "text": "Too dark to see."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_252",
      "text": "I cannot find it anywhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_253",
      "text": "You can also see"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_254",
      "text": "Very good."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_001",
      "text": "SANCHO: \"Try a specific action.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_005",
      "text": "Specks of dirt."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_006",
      "text": "A book of chivalry."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_007",
      "text": "It is full of books."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_008",
      "text": "It has a curious fastening."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_009",
      "text": "You must begin the adventure first."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_010",
      "text": "You must do something else first."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_011",
      "text": "You are on the upper floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_012",
      "text": "Fool! Who climbs out of a window?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_013",
      "text": "A stone wall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_014",
      "text": "A mosaic floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_015",
      "text": "If it rains, you will get wet."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_016",
      "text": "The adventure begins."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_017",
      "text": "You put on the armour."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_018",
      "text": "You are already wearing it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_019",
      "text": "It looks comfortable."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_020",
      "text": "No time for nonsense."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_021",
      "text": "It is already made."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_022",
      "text": "They are silk."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_023",
      "text": "A shame to unmake the bed."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_024",
      "text": "Among the old relics you find some armour."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_025",
      "text": "Nothing else of interest."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_026",
      "text": "You lift it, but it is too heavy. You put it down again."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_027",
      "text": "Too dark to see."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_028",
      "text": "You hear noises inside."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_029",
      "text": "There is a key."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_030",
      "text": "You already opened it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_031",
      "text": "A rat leaps out and bites you. You are dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_032",
      "text": "A rat leaps out to bite you, but breaks its teeth on your armour."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_033",
      "text": "You put your head up the chimney. Soot falls in your face."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_034",
      "text": "There is a rat hole."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_035",
      "text": "The door is shut."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_036",
      "text": "It gives plenty of light."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_037",
      "text": "Part of the decoration."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_038",
      "text": "You open the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_039",
      "text": "You need a tool."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_040",
      "text": "A sword and shield hang on the wall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_003",
      "text": "SANCHO: \"You should become a knight.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_041",
      "text": "A shield hangs on the wall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_042",
      "text": "A twelfth-century shield."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_043",
      "text": "It is pine wood."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_044",
      "text": "Its steps are two and a half metres wide."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_045",
      "text": "The fourth one is loose."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_046",
      "text": "The stairs now have one step less."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_047",
      "text": "To be a knight, keep watch over your arms at an inn where you can see the moon."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_048",
      "text": "They vary in size."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_049",
      "text": "Dark and lonely."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_050",
      "text": "The walls of the houses."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_051",
      "text": "It is earth."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_052",
      "text": "You are not a ghost."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_053",
      "text": "You climb onto the stone."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_054",
      "text": "You are already up there."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_055",
      "text": "It is not here."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_056",
      "text": "Too high."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_057",
      "text": "They are very tall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_058",
      "text": "You climb, but near the top you lose your footing and fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_059",
      "text": "Very little grows here."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_060",
      "text": "Just a few thistles."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_061",
      "text": "You try to take it, but prick yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_062",
      "text": "You fall into the ravine."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_063",
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_064",
      "text": "You lay the plank across the ravine. It forms a bridge."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_065",
      "text": "Too wide."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_066",
      "text": "About two and a half metres wide."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_067",
      "text": "One candle is loose."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_068",
      "text": "The innkeeper opens the door. You enter."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_069",
      "text": "It is locked."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_070",
      "text": "You fill the bottle."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_071",
      "text": "They contain wine."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_072",
      "text": "A fine old Rioja."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_073",
      "text": "You might get drunk."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_074",
      "text": "The wine spills across the room. You have no container."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_075",
      "text": "Remember, you believe they are bandits."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_076",
      "text": "Too high."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_077",
      "text": "You see a death cap mushroom."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_078",
      "text": "It is already uprooted."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_079",
      "text": "You see a saffron milkcap mushroom."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_080",
      "text": "An apple falls."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_081",
      "text": "It bears apples."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_082",
      "text": "Nothing else falls."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_083",
      "text": "You have finished part one. The password is: \"THE BALM OF FIERABRAS\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_084",
      "text": "The sheep move aside."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_085",
      "text": "The shepherd grows angry and beats you."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_086",
      "text": "You think it is an army."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_087",
      "text": "Now bring an object that may be useful later."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_088",
      "text": "Pure wool."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_089",
      "text": "Its lock is broken."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_090",
      "text": "A good blow might fix it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_091",
      "text": "You are a true knight now."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_092",
      "text": "You already did that."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_093",
      "text": "You try to keep vigil over your arms, but fall asleep from exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_094",
      "text": "A good knight must not fall asleep."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_095",
      "text": "I have no arms to watch over."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_096",
      "text": "You see a lovely landscape."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_097",
      "text": "Your front door."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_098",
      "text": "The edge of the village."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_099",
      "text": "You see inside the houses."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_100",
      "text": "The hills are far away."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_101",
      "text": "A cart track."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_102",
      "text": "They are pine trees."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_103",
      "text": "You start climbing, but lose your footing and fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_104",
      "text": "They are colourful."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_105",
      "text": "It is an inn."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_106",
      "text": "It leads upstairs."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_107",
      "text": "A mushroom."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_004",
      "text": "SANCHO: \"Find something for the balm of Fierabras.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_108",
      "text": "It is red."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_109",
      "text": "It is dry."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_110",
      "text": "It is iron."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_111",
      "text": "Cock-a-doodle-doo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_112",
      "text": "It is calcite."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_113",
      "text": "It is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_114",
      "text": "It is full of wine."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_115",
      "text": "The blade is sharp."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_116",
      "text": "Try that in another adventure."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_117",
      "text": "It is planted."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_118",
      "text": "It hangs from a tree."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_119",
      "text": "Many apples fall. One hits your head. You asked for it!"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_120",
      "text": "Speak for yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_121",
      "text": "Night falls."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_122",
      "text": "Dawn breaks."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_123",
      "text": "You are getting hungry."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_124",
      "text": "You cannot last without food."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_125",
      "text": "Nothing unusual."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_126",
      "text": "I cannot fight without arms."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_127",
      "text": "You are not a knight yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_128",
      "text": "I cannot go that way."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_129",
      "text": "Delicious."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_207",
      "text": "Time passes..."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_156",
      "text": "Have some modesty."
    },
    {
      "id": "a_message_157",
      "text": "Do not be rough!"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_001",
      "text": "A CRUST OF BREAD"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_002",
      "text": "AN APPLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_003",
      "text": "A HEN"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_004",
      "text": "A SAFFRON MILKCAP"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_005",
      "text": "A DEATH CAP"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_006",
      "text": "A BOOK"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_007",
      "text": "SOME ARMOUR"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_008",
      "text": "A KEY"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_009",
      "text": "A PLANK"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_010",
      "text": "A SWORD"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_011",
      "text": "A BOTTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_012",
      "text": "A CANDLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_013",
      "text": "A HAMMER"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_014",
      "text": "A RAKE"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_015",
      "text": "A STONE"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_object_100",
      "text": "A SHIRT"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0030_0",
      "text": "DON QUIXOTE PART I"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0030_1",
      "text": "PROGRAM:EGROJ"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0030_2",
      "text": "MSX VERSION:MARCOS JOURON"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0030_3",
      "text": "GRAPHICS:PABLO AND EGROJ"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0030_4",
