    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_0070_0",
      "text": "NAME?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_6010_0",
      "text": "SANCHO:YOU SHOULD FIND A KEY"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_basic_7300_0",
      "text": "LOAD OR SAVE ERROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_011",
      "text": "You enter the windmill. Sacks lie in the middle of the room. The exit is west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_001",
      "text": "Lovely countryside in La Mancha. Sheep block the way west. The path continues east."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_002",
      "text": "Monks guard a carriage halted on the road. The road runs west to south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_021",
      "text": "You skirt an oak wood. The winding path leads east and north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_022",
      "text": "Sunbeams filter through this splendid wood. You can go south, east or west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_023",
      "text": "The border of wood and mountain. You can go east or west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_024",
      "text": "Deep in the wood, fallen leaves carpet the ground. Exits lead east and south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_025",
      "text": "The forest path splits three ways: south, north and west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_026",
      "text": "A village lies nearby to the west. The wood continues north and east."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_027",
      "text": "Woods everywhere! All paths lead into them. Choose east, west or north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_028",
      "text": "You follow a woodland path. An inn door lies south. You can also go east or west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_029",
      "text": "An orange tree in La Mancha! As strange as an apple tree! Yet here it stands. The path runs north to west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_031",
      "text": "A gloomy street in Almagro. The street runs east to south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_032",
      "text": "A windmill stands far to the north. From this lovely street in Almagro, you can go east."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_033",
      "text": "You are in the main square. Streets lead north, south and west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_034",
      "text": "The alley ends here. Perhaps the doors to the south and west lead somewhere new. I would try south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_003",
      "text": "These plains of La Mancha are so dry. The path ends here. Go south to return."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_004",
      "text": "A typical windmill stands to the east. The path runs south to north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_005",
      "text": "This cart track leads north. The village lies behind you, to the south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_012",
      "text": "A cosy room in Almagro. This house reminds you of a special place. The door is east."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_013",
      "text": "You enter the barber's shop. A mirror fills the left wall. The exit is north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_014",
      "text": "You are in the inn's entrance. A guard watches a door to the east. A sign hangs on the wall. The exit is north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_015",
      "text": "Dim light reveals three doors: east, south and west. Little else is of interest."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_041",
      "text": "You are in a dark cave. The earth has been disturbed. The exit is east."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_042",
      "text": "The path ends here. A cave entrance lies west. A lion guards this place. You can also go south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_044",
      "text": "Stones roll downhill as you follow the path east to north. Better not look down."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_043",
      "text": "You reach the summit. La Mancha stretches below in a magnificent view. You can go south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_045",
      "text": "A narrow trail splits into three dreadful paths: east, north and south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_046",
      "text": "From this hillside, go west to the wood, or north or south through the hills."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_047",
      "text": "You stand at the foot of the hills. A steep trail climbs north. If heights frighten you, go south."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_016",
      "text": "An inn bedroom. A window breaks the bare wall. You can go west."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_017",
      "text": "One of the inn's two bedrooms. A lovely view lies beyond the window. You can go north."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_060",
      "text": "You are atop an orange tree. It bears no fruit. Climb down before you fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_room_201",
      "text": "To play this part, type the password."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_001",
      "text": "The sheep block your way."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_002",
      "text": "The shepherd strikes you dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_003",
      "text": "The carriage blocks your way."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_004",
      "text": "Outnumbered, you are defeated."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_005",
      "text": "MONK: \"Rising early will not make the sun rise sooner.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_006",
      "text": "The carriage moves aside."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_007",
      "text": "A maiden is inside."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_008",
      "text": "You cannot."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_009",
      "text": "The monks stop you."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_010",
      "text": "A monk drops something."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_011",
      "text": "Wind turns its sails."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_012",
      "text": "A sail strikes your head."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_013",
      "text": "You mistake them for giants and attack. Your lance catches in a sail. You fall from a great height."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_014",
      "text": "They are wooden."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_015",
      "text": "It is oak wood."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_016",
      "text": "You see La Mancha."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_017",
      "text": "A maiden enters. It is Dulcinea! Congratulations, my friend. You have succeeded."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_018",
      "text": "The barber appears and shaves you. He leaves, forgetting his basin."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_019",
      "text": "The barber appears, cuts your hair and leaves."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_020",
      "text": "That face looks familiar."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_021",
      "text": "GUARD: \"You may not pass.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_022",
      "text": "GUARD: \"You lack something a good knight needs.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_023",
      "text": "Only for knights of high standing."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_024",
      "text": "The guard opens the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_025",
      "text": "As you make it, something falls to the floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_026",
      "text": "It is already made."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_027",
      "text": "The bed is unmade."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_028",
      "text": "A quilt covers the bed."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_029",
      "text": "You see a rosemary bush."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_030",
      "text": "You already did that."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_031",
      "text": "Very good."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_032",
      "text": "Excellent."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_033",
      "text": "The lion blocks your way. Angered, it bites you. You are dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_034",
      "text": "You merely tickle it with your sword tip."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_035",
      "text": "It never fails. Music soothes savage beasts."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_036",
      "text": "A large cauldron appears."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_239",
      "text": "You carry"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_241",
      "text": "You cannot."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_242",
      "text": "Pardon?"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_243",
      "text": "Press a key..."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_244",
      "text": "Are you sure? (Y/N)"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_245",
      "text": "You already have it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_246",
      "text": "You do not have it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_247",
      "text": "You cannot see it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_248",
      "text": "You carry too much to take that."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_251",
      "text": "Too dark to see."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_252",
      "text": "I cannot find it anywhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_253",
      "text": "You can also see"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_254",
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_040",
      "text": "It is heavy."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_041",
      "text": "Traces of salt lie among the wheat sacks."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_042",
      "text": "Sacks of wheat."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_037",
      "text": "The earth is reddish."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_043",
      "text": "Why spoil the scenery?"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_044",
      "text": "Balm of Fierabras: put wine, oil, rosemary and salt in the cauldron. Mix them, and it is ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_045",
      "text": "You trip on a stone, fall and hurt your leg. Slowly, you get up."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_046",
      "text": "Is that really a wise way to provoke a lion?"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_070",
      "text": "After digging a large hole, you find a huge cauldron."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_071",
      "text": "Surely not with your fingers?"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_072",
      "text": "Bubble, bubble..."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_073",
      "text": "An ingredient is missing from the potion."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_075",
      "text": "You need a tool."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_076",
      "text": "Argh! Awful, but effective."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_077",
      "text": "No balm remains. You already drank it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_078",
      "text": "The balm is inside."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_079",
      "text": "Nothing here."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_080",
      "text": "It is rusty iron."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_081",
      "text": "The door is shut."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_082",
      "text": "You open the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_083",
      "text": "You have no key."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_084",
      "text": "You already opened it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_100",
      "text": "I think you are trying to cheat."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_105",
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_120",
      "text": "Trees, grasses and plants that dwell here..."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_150",
      "text": "Freshly baked."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_151",
      "text": "It is dry."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_152",
      "text": "Ready to eat."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_153",
      "text": "A fine feast for pigs."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_154",
      "text": "Its edge gleams."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_155",
      "text": "Blue and red checks."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_156",
      "text": "It reads D.T."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_160",
      "text": "Your fall still hurts."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_161",
      "text": "The pain is unbearable. You can go no further."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_162",
      "text": "Urgh... phew!"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_164",
      "text": "Your stomach rumbles."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_165",
      "text": "You cannot last without food."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_157",
      "text": "What a vintage!"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_158",
      "text": "Argh! Horrible."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_159",
      "text": "I cannot fight without arms."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_223",
      "text": "A branch falls and strikes your head."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_224",
      "text": "Some acorns fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_200",
      "text": "There is a shelf."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_201",
      "text": "You see a loaf of bread."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_202",
      "text": "It is oak wood."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_203",
      "text": "A bramble laden with blackberries."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_204",
      "text": "No berries remain."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_205",
      "text": "You open the wardrobe."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_206",
      "text": "It is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_207",
      "text": "There is a piece of cod."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_208",
      "text": "There is a wardrobe."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_209",
      "text": "It is already open."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_214",
      "text": "Varied and diverse."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_210",
      "text": "It is earth."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_211",
      "text": "It is made of tiles."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_212",
      "text": "It is brick."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_213",
      "text": "These monks stand firmly before you."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_215",
      "text": "Not a cloud."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_216",
      "text": "Of many kinds."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_217",
      "text": "You see outside."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_218",
      "text": "It has four legs."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_197",
      "text": "Thank you for the compliment."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_198",
      "text": "No violence, thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_199",
      "text": "SANCHO: \"An ingenious gentleman needs help? Amazing!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_235",
      "text": "You lose your footing and fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_message_236",
      "text": "The branches cannot bear your weight. You fall."
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_001",
      "text": "A BASIN"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_002",
      "text": "A KEY"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_003",
      "text": "SOME SALT"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_004",
      "text": "SOME ROSEMARY"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_005",
      "text": "A SCROLL"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_006",
      "text": "A BOTTLE OF WINE"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_007",
      "text": "A SWORD"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_008",
      "text": "A SHOVEL"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_009",
      "text": "A BOTTLE OF OIL"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_010",
      "text": "A CLEAR BOTTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_011",
      "text": "AN EMPTY BOTTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_012",
      "text": "A TWIG"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_013",
      "text": "A CAULDRON"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_014",
      "text": "A LOAF OF BREAD"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_015",
      "text": "A PIECE OF COD"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_016",
      "text": "SOME BLACKBERRIES"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_017",
      "text": "TWO DOZEN ACORNS"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_018",
      "text": "A NAIL"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_object_045",
      "text": "A SHIRT"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_basic_0030_0",
      "text": "DON QUIXOTE PART II"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_basic_0030_1",
      "text": "PROGRAM:EGROJ"
    },
    {
      "id": "b_basic_0030_2",
      "text": "MSX VERSION:MARCOS JOURON"
    },
